msgctxt "68\t169"
msgid "All right. What do you need me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "178\t327"
msgid ""
"Well... with Saki-san gone and all,\\n"
"the boss is kinda losin' it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "329\t456"
msgid ""
"So we need some help pulling him back.\\n"
"Talk some sense into him, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "479\t540"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "545\t714"
msgid ""
"The boss took a shine to you\\n"
"the moment you stepped foot in our office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "751\t807"
msgid "You're the only one he'll listen to, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "809\t857"
msgid "Stop right there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "859\t890"
msgid "...Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892\t1065"
msgid ""
"What are you getting at here?\\n"
"It's all \"aniki\" this and \"aniki\" that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1126\t1189"
msgid "I mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1195\t1273"
msgid "It's 'cause you're my aniki. Duh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1275\t1465"
msgid ""
"You're the captain of the Ryudo Family.\\n"
"I'm nothing to you, especially not your aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1514\t1579"
msgid "Eh, let's talk about this later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1581\t1690"
msgid ""
"No. I can't have a yakuza\\n"
"talking to me like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692\t1767"
msgid "What would my kids think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1770\t1949"
msgid ""
"C'mon, just let it slide!\\n"
"I respect your strength, that's all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1951\t2064"
msgid ""
"Don't you see?\\n"
"You're my aniki, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2123\t2270"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm gonna go pull the car around!\\n"
"See ya soon, Aniki!"
msgstr ""